    <string name="adb_pair_body">The 6-digit code is in the Wireless Debugging screen. Enter it here — DO NOT press Back (that kills the pairing session). Use the grid below: ring swipe to navigate, TAP to commit. Without a ring: two-finger temple swipe to move focus, single tap to select.</string>
